<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Adrian Taboada Perez — Engineering Portfolio</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0e14;
      --surface: #0f141c;
      --card: #131924;
      --border: #232c3a;
      --accent: #5b9df0;
      --accent2: #3ddbd9;
      --text: #e4e9f0;
      --muted: #7c8797;
      --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    /* ─── NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
      background: rgba(13,13,13,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    /* ─── HERO ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 110px 4rem 5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-grid-overlay {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(91,157,240,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(91,157,240,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 760px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }
    .hero-eyebrow::before {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 2rem;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--accent);
    }
    .hero-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 7.5vw, 6.4rem);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .hero-name .accent { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    }
    .hero-bio {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #aaa;
      max-width: 620px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
    .hero-bio strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0a0e14;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #82b8f5; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--text); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    /* ─── SECTION SHARED ──────────────────────────────── */
    section { padding: 6rem 4rem; }
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
    .section-number {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .section-line {
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }
    /* ─── SKILLS ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .skills-section { background: var(--surface); }
    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .skill-item {
      background: var(--card);
      padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .skill-item:hover { background: #1e1e1e; }
    .skill-category {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .skill-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .skill-tag {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    /* ─── PROJECTS ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .project-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
      animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;
    }
    .project-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #444;
    }
    .project-card.featured {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
    .project-tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.2rem; right: 1.2rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .tag-burpg { background: rgba(91,157,240,0.15); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid rgba(91,157,240,0.3); }
    .tag-industry { background: rgba(61,219,217,0.15); color: var(--accent2); border: 1px solid rgba(61,219,217,0.3); }
    .tag-embedded { background: rgba(110,180,230,0.15); color: #8ec4ee; border: 1px solid rgba(110,180,230,0.3); }
    .tag-cfd { background: rgba(80,200,225,0.15); color: #6fd0e8; border: 1px solid rgba(80,200,225,0.3); }
    .tag-mech { background: rgba(140,130,240,0.15); color: #a9a0f2; border: 1px solid rgba(140,130,240,0.3); }
    .tag-dynamics { background: rgba(120,145,255,0.15); color: #9bb0ff; border: 1px solid rgba(120,145,255,0.3); }
    .project-visual {
      height: 180px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 5rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .project-card.featured .project-visual { height: 220px; }
    .project-visual-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .project-body { padding: 1.8rem; }
    .project-index {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }
    .project-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .project-org {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--accent2);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .project-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #999;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }
    .project-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .pill {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    /* visual gradients per project */
    .v-swage { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(61,219,217,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-rocket { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(91,157,240,0.28) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-nozzle { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(120,145,255,0.3) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-blood { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(140,130,240,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-draw { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(80,200,225,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-calib { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(150,170,255,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .v-cad { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 80%, rgba(50,200,240,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    /* ─── PROJECT DETAIL HINT ─────────────────────────── */
    .project-card { cursor: pointer; }
    .project-hint {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: gap 0.2s;
    }
    .project-card:hover .project-hint { gap: 0.7rem; }
    /* ─── PROJECT MODAL ───────────────────────────────── */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(6,8,12,0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      display: none;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 6vh 1.5rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
    .modal-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      max-width: 760px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      position: relative;
      animation: fadeUp 0.25s ease both;
    }
    .modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.2rem; right: 1.2rem;
      width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .modal-close:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); }
    .modal-index {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .modal-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      line-height: 1.05;
      max-width: 85%;
    }
    .modal-org {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent2);
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
    }
    .modal-body p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #a9a9a9;
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }
    .modal-body p strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
    .modal-pills {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem;
      margin: 1.6rem 0 1.6rem;
    }
    .modal-link {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(91,157,240,0.4);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .modal-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
    /* ─── CONTACT ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .contact-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem 4rem 5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .contact-section::before {
      content: 'CONNECT';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20vw;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      pointer-events: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .contact-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .contact-heading {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .contact-sub {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    /* ─── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    footer {
      padding: 2rem 4rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    footer span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    /* ─── ANIMATIONS ──────────────────────────────────── */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .hero-content > * {
      animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease both;
    }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
    .hero-content > *:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
    /* ─── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { padding: 100px 1.5rem 3rem; }
      section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
      .project-card.featured { grid-column: span 1; }
      .projects-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <span class="nav-logo">ATP // PORTFOLIO</span>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-grid-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Mechatronics &amp; Electromechanical Design</div>
    <h1 class="hero-name">ADRIAN<br><span class="accent">TABOADA</span><br>PEREZ</h1>
    <p class="hero-title">MECHATRONICS · POWER ELECTRONICS · CONTROL SYSTEMS</p>
    <p class="hero-bio">
      I graduated from <strong>Boston University</strong> in May 2026 with a BS in Mechanical Engineering and a
      minor in Electrical Engineering, and I'm now working on an MS in Mechanical Engineering at
      <strong>Carnegie Mellon University</strong>, focusing on robotics and control systems — graduating spring
      2028, if all goes to plan.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-bio">
      Most of what I end up building needs both a mechanical engineer and an electrical engineer in the room, so
      that's usually the project I go looking for: something that needs a part machined, a circuit built, and code
      written before it actually does anything. Pumps, grippers, flight computers, whatever — if it has to move and
      it has to be controlled, I'm interested.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects</a>
      <a href="mailto:adriantaboadaperez@gmail.com" class="btn btn-outline">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section id="projects">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-number">// 00</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">PROJECTS</h2>
    <div class="section-line"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="projects-grid">
    <!-- 1. Tube Swaging Automation -->
    <div class="project-card featured" data-project="1">
      <span class="project-tag tag-industry">Automation</span>
      <div class="project-visual">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-swage"></div>
        <span>AUTO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">01 — Automation + Controls</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">TUBE SWAGING AUTOMATION</h3>
        <div class="project-org">Vita Needle Company &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sep 2025 – May 2026</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Designed and built an automation device for Vita Needle's tube swaging process, using a lead-screw
          actuator, pneumatic gripper, and custom gripper jaws to load needles into the swaging machine — replacing
          the manual feeding process and achieving 98% consistent, high-quality swages. Developed the full electrical
          control system and HMI: a microcontroller-driven state machine, Hall-effect position sensing,
          solenoid-driven gripper actuation, OLED display, and a fail-safe E-STOP circuit built from relays and
          contactors for reliable operator safety.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">Lead-Screw Actuator</span>
          <span class="pill">Pneumatic Gripper</span>
          <span class="pill">Arduino</span>
          <span class="pill">Hall Effect</span>
          <span class="pill">HMI</span>
          <span class="pill">E-STOP Safety Circuit</span>
          <span class="pill">KiCad</span>
          <span class="pill">CNC Machining</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 2. Centrifugal Fuel Pump -->
    <div class="project-card featured" data-project="2">
      <span class="project-tag tag-burpg">Propulsion</span>
      <div class="project-visual">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-rocket"></div>
        <span>PUMP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">02 — Mechanical Design + Electronics</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">CENTRIFUGAL FUEL PUMP</h3>
        <div class="project-org">BU Rocket Propulsion Group (BURPG) &nbsp;·&nbsp; Oct 2025 – Dec 2025</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Modeled and manufactured a centrifugal fuel pump for BURPG's liquid bipropellant propulsion system —
          3D-printed the impeller and housing, machined a custom aluminum shaft, and integrated a brushless DC
          motor. Sized the pump from first principles (Bernoulli, continuity, momentum) to hit a 75 mL/s flow rate
          and 21 ft head target, and optimized impeller geometry using fluid dynamics simulations. Designed a
          custom analog motor driver — 555-timer PWM stage into a MOSFET H-bridge — for speed and direction control.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">SolidWorks</span>
          <span class="pill">BLDC Motor</span>
          <span class="pill">Fluid Dynamics</span>
          <span class="pill">3D Printing</span>
          <span class="pill">Lathe &amp; Mill</span>
          <span class="pill">555 Timer PWM</span>
          <span class="pill">H-Bridge</span>
          <span class="pill">KiCad</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 3. Nozzle + Ignition -->
    <div class="project-card featured" data-project="3">
      <span class="project-tag tag-burpg">Propulsion</span>
      <div class="project-visual">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-nozzle"></div>
        <span>FIRE</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">03 — Propulsion + Embedded</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">ROCKET NOZZLE &amp; IGNITION CONTROL SYSTEM</h3>
        <div class="project-org">BU Rocket Propulsion Group (BURPG) &nbsp;·&nbsp; Sep 2024 – Dec 2024</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Modeled multiple fixed-geometry rocket nozzles in SolidWorks, achieving a simulated 12% thrust efficiency
          gain over baseline through iterative thermal-load FEA, then 3D-printed and test-fired the selected design.
          Engineered the flight computer in C++ around a microcontroller, using NMOS driver stages to synchronize
          solenoid valve actuation and electronic-match ignition, with SD-card data logging from a load cell during
          live nozzle firings at target conditions.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">SolidWorks</span>
          <span class="pill">FEA</span>
          <span class="pill">Arduino Nano</span>
          <span class="pill">C++</span>
          <span class="pill">Load Cell DAQ</span>
          <span class="pill">Propulsion Theory</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 4. Blood Pump -->
    <div class="project-card" data-project="4">
      <span class="project-tag tag-mech">Biomedical</span>
      <div class="project-visual" style="height:160px">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-blood"></div>
        <span>PUMP</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">04 — Mechanical + Controls</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">PERISTALTIC BLOOD PUMP</h3>
        <div class="project-org">Boston University &nbsp;·&nbsp; Biomedical Engineering Lab</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Contributed to a peristaltic pump prototype for biomedical laboratory use, focused on a compact
          mechanically driven pumping system. Machined key structural components in aluminum on the lathe and mill
          for precise motor alignment, and developed an analog motor driver circuit for velocity control during
          testing.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">Lathe &amp; Mill</span>
          <span class="pill">Analog Circuits</span>
          <span class="pill">Motor Control</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 5. Drawing Machine -->
    <div class="project-card" data-project="5">
      <span class="project-tag tag-embedded">Electromech</span>
      <div class="project-visual" style="height:160px">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-draw"></div>
        <span>DRAW</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">05 — Electromechanical Design</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">TWO-COLOR DRAWING MACHINE</h3>
        <div class="project-org">Boston University &nbsp;·&nbsp; Personal Project</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Designed and built a two-axis CNC drawing machine with a custom aluminum frame and a 3D-printed
          pen-change mechanism. Built the full software pipeline — image-to-G-code conversion in Python and motion
          control via Repetier-Host — to convert any PNG into a clean two-color drawing with repeatable pen
          registration.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">Python</span>
          <span class="pill">G-code</span>
          <span class="pill">Stepper Motors</span>
          <span class="pill">3D Printing</span>
          <span class="pill">CNC</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 6. Calibration -->
    <div class="project-card" data-project="6">
      <span class="project-tag tag-dynamics">Dynamics</span>
      <div class="project-visual" style="height:160px">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-calib"></div>
        <span>FREQ</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">06 — Instrumentation + Analysis</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">CALIBRATION OF A MECHANICAL SYSTEM</h3>
        <div class="project-org">Boston University &nbsp;·&nbsp; Coursework</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Built and instrumented a spring-mass oscillator test rig with an optical displacement sensor and DAQ
          board. Developed a calibration pipeline to extract resonance behavior, validated the magnitude ratio and
          phase response against the theoretical model, and estimated dynamic parameters (k, ζ, ωn) with propagated
          uncertainty.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">MATLAB</span>
          <span class="pill">DAQ</span>
          <span class="pill">Vibrations</span>
          <span class="pill">Uncertainty Analysis</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 7. CFD / COMSOL -->
    <div class="project-card" data-project="7">
      <span class="project-tag tag-cfd">Simulation</span>
      <div class="project-visual" style="height:160px">
        <div class="project-visual-bg v-cad"></div>
        <span>SIM</span>
      </div>
      <div class="project-body">
        <div class="project-index">07 — Simulation + Analysis</div>
        <h3 class="project-title">CAD &amp; SIMULATION HIGHLIGHTS</h3>
        <div class="project-org">Boston University &nbsp;·&nbsp; Coursework / Research</div>
        <p class="project-desc">
          Independently modeled assemblies and ran simulations across multiple projects: a COMSOL conjugate heat
          transfer model of a heated fluid past a sphere across Reynolds numbers (validated against the
          lumped-capacitance model), OpenFOAM CFD studies (cylinder flow, channel flow, airfoil), and SolidWorks FEA
          for structural and thermal validation on rocket hardware.
        </p>
        <div class="project-pills">
          <span class="pill">OpenFOAM</span>
          <span class="pill">COMSOL</span>
          <span class="pill">SolidWorks FEA</span>
          <span class="pill">MATLAB</span>
          <span class="pill">ParaView</span>
        </div>
        <span class="project-hint">View details →</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
